From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jiaxing Hu <gahing@gahingwoo.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 16:31:13 +1300
Subject: [PATCH] rocket: four IOMMU clocks, and a single power domain allowed
 (TEST ONLY)

The NPU IOMMUs drop the npu clock, as in v16. rocket_core_init() skips
the multi-domain attach when the node lists only one power domain, so
that one domain per core can be tried from an overlay. Fork CI only.

Signed-off-by: Jiaxing Hu <gahing@gahingwoo.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3576.dtsi | 12 ++++--------
 drivers/accel/rocket/rocket_core.c       |  4 +++-
 2 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3576.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3576.dtsi
index ce96e639a0be..eeee6f886a01 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3576.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3576.dtsi
@@ -1296,10 +1296,8 @@ rknn_mmu_0: iommu@27702000 {
 			      <0x0 0x27702100 0x0 0x100>;
 			interrupts = <GIC_SPI 247 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
 			clocks = <&cru ACLK_RKNN0>, <&cru HCLK_RKNN_ROOT>,
-				 <&cru CLK_RKNN_DSU0>, <&cru ACLK_RKNN_CBUF>,
-				 <&cru HCLK_RKNN_CBUF>;
-			clock-names = "aclk", "iface", "npu",
-				      "aclk_cbuf", "hclk_cbuf";
+				 <&cru ACLK_RKNN_CBUF>, <&cru HCLK_RKNN_CBUF>;
+			clock-names = "aclk", "iface", "aclk_cbuf", "hclk_cbuf";
 			#iommu-cells = <0>;
 			power-domains = <&power RK3576_PD_NPU0>;
 			status = "disabled";
@@ -1332,10 +1330,8 @@ rknn_mmu_1: iommu@2770a000 {
 			      <0x0 0x2770a100 0x0 0x100>;
 			interrupts = <GIC_SPI 248 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
 			clocks = <&cru ACLK_RKNN1>, <&cru HCLK_RKNN_ROOT>,
-				 <&cru CLK_RKNN_DSU0>, <&cru ACLK_RKNN_CBUF>,
-				 <&cru HCLK_RKNN_CBUF>;
-			clock-names = "aclk", "iface", "npu",
-				      "aclk_cbuf", "hclk_cbuf";
+				 <&cru ACLK_RKNN_CBUF>, <&cru HCLK_RKNN_CBUF>;
+			clock-names = "aclk", "iface", "aclk_cbuf", "hclk_cbuf";
 			#iommu-cells = <0>;
 			power-domains = <&power RK3576_PD_NPU1>;
 			status = "disabled";
diff --git a/drivers/accel/rocket/rocket_core.c b/drivers/accel/rocket/rocket_core.c
index 9d6d2bc54d80..d356b34f42e5 100644
--- a/drivers/accel/rocket/rocket_core.c
+++ b/drivers/accel/rocket/rocket_core.c
@@ -63,7 +63,9 @@ int rocket_core_init(struct rocket_core *core)
 	if (err)
 		return err;
 
-	if (core->soc->multi_power_domain) {
+	if (core->soc->multi_power_domain &&
+	    of_count_phandle_with_args(dev->of_node, "power-domains",
+				       "#power-domain-cells") > 1) {
 		struct dev_pm_domain_list *pd_list;
 
 		err = devm_pm_domain_attach_list(dev, NULL, &pd_list);
-- 
2.43.0

